@startuml Sequence Diagram - Login
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundCorner 15
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #34495E
    LifeLineBorderColor #7F8C8D
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    BoxBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
    BoxBorderColor #DEE2E6
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    BorderColor #F9A825
    FontSize 11
}

title <size:22><b>Academic Event Management System</b></size>\n<size:16><color:#666666>Sequence Diagram — User Authentication & Login</color></size>\n
footer <size:10>Prepared for Black Book Submission | Academic Event Management System</size>

actor "<b>Student / Admin</b>" as User
participant "<b>React Frontend</b>\n(Login Page)" as FE
participant "<b>AuthController</b>\n(/api/auth)" as Auth
participant "<b>SecurityConfig</b>\n(JWT Filter)" as Filter
participant "<b>CustomUserDetailsService</b>" as UDS
participant "<b>PasswordEncoder</b>\n(Bcrypt)" as Encoder
participant "<b>JwtUtil</b>\n(HS256)" as JWT
database "<b>PostgreSQL</b>\n(users table)" as DB

== Phase 1: User Submits Login Credentials ==

User -> FE : Enter email, password\nand select role
activate FE
FE -> Auth : **POST** /api/auth/login\n`{ "email": "...", "password": "..." }`
activate Auth

Auth -> DB : findByEmail(email)
activate DB
DB --> Auth : User object\n(id, password, role)
deactivate DB

Auth -> Encoder : matches(rawPassword,\nencodedPassword)
activate Encoder
Encoder --> Auth : **true** (password verified)
deactivate Encoder

Auth -> JWT : generateToken(email, role)\n(HMAC-SHA256 algorithm)
activate JWT
JWT --> Auth : JWT Token\n(expires in 24 hours)
deactivate JWT

Auth --> FE : **200 OK**\n`{ "token": "eyJhbG...", "userId": 5,\n"roleName": "STUDENT", "message": "Login successful" }`
deactivate Auth

FE -> FE : Store token, userId,\nrole in localStorage
FE -> FE : Set Axios default header:\n`Authorization: Bearer <token>`

FE --> User : Redirect to **Dashboard**
deactivate FE

note over User, DB
  <b>Security Flow:</b>
  1. Passwords are BCrypt-hashed (never stored plain text)
  2. JWT token signed with HS256 algorithm
  3. Token contains email + role claims
  4. Token expires after 24 hours
  5. Frontend stores token in localStorage
end note

== Phase 2: Authenticated API Request ==

User -> FE : Click any protected page
activate FE
FE -> Filter : HTTP Request\n`Authorization: Bearer eyJhbG...`
activate Filter

Filter -> JWT : validateToken(token)
activate JWT
JWT --> Filter : **true** (token valid, not expired)
deactivate JWT

Filter -> Filter : Extract email from token\nSet SecurityContext
Filter -> UDS : loadUserByUsername(email)
activate UDS
UDS -> DB : findByEmail(email)
activate DB
DB --> UDS : User
deactivate DB
UDS --> Filter : UserDetails
deactivate UDS

Filter --> FE : Request passed security\n(servlet chain continues)
deactivate Filter

FE --> User : Display protected content
deactivate FE

@enduml
